  "text": "312313 01/31/230.00 B7 S0.00 T190.0 Clear Creek\nBINOYASACANAINAНZАОНА BIlI\nExhibit B\nSchedule of Fees and Charges\nI. Fees for Hazmat Services, Motor Vehicle Accidents and Safety Services\n1. General Provisions\nFees will be charged for roadway response Services provided by the Authority, including,\nbut not limited to, Hlazmat materials response, containment and mitigation Services and motor\nvehicle accident rescue and lane safety protection provided by the Authority. Roadway\nresponse Services are subject to the Base: Response Fce, as well as any Response Apparatus\nand Commnand/Staff Fees applicable to the response.\nA. Response Apparatus and Command/Staff Fees will be rounded up or do wn to the nearest\nhalf-hour increment, with a half-hour minimum. Hours charged is determined by the\nen-- route time and in-service time logged for the response per the dispatch records\n2. Base Response Fee by Type of Incident\nA. Hazardous Materials Response\nB. Motor Vehicle Accident\nResponse\n3. Response Apparatus & Command/Staff Fees\nA. Type I Engine\nB. Type III Engine\nC. Heavy Rescue/Hazmat\nD. Water Tender\nE. Type VI Bngine\nF. Aerial Truck\nG. Command/Staff Vebicles\n$250\n$250\n$250/hr\n$220/hr\n$220/hr\n$190/hr\n$165/h1\n$280/hr\n$60/hr\n.-.\n.....\n.. .\n•\nPage 6\n2024-02-07 Ord #18 Final.docx",
